{"seq":2,"slug":"muzero-and-planning","title":"MuZero 与基于模型的规划","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/world-models-simulation/classical-world-models/muzero-and-planning","wordCount":1685,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"muzero-与基于模型的规划\">MuZero 与基于模型的规划</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>MuZero 是 DeepMind 在 2019 年发布的算法，把 AlphaGo 系列的规划能力推广到一般决策问题。与 AlphaZero 需要精确的环境规则不同，MuZero 学习一个内部模型——给定状态和动作，预测下一状态、奖励、与价值。然后用这个学到的模型做 MCTS 树搜索，选择最佳动作。这种&quot;学习模型 + MCTS 规划&quot;的范式让 MuZero 在棋类、Atari、推荐系统等极其多样的场景中都达到顶级水平，是当前最具通用性的基于模型 RL 算法之一。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[MuZero 框架] --&gt; B[表征函数 h]&#10;    A --&gt; C[动力学函数 g]&#10;    A --&gt; D[预测函数 f]&#10;    B --&gt; E[观察 → 隐状态]&#10;    C --&gt; F[隐状态 + 动作 → 下一隐状态 + 奖励]&#10;    D --&gt; G[隐状态 → 价值 + 策略]&#10;    E --&gt; H[MCTS 树搜索]&#10;    F --&gt; H&#10;    G --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; I[最佳动作]\">graph TD\n    A[MuZero 框架] --&gt; B[表征函数 h]\n    A --&gt; C[动力学函数 g]\n    A --&gt; D[预测函数 f]\n    B --&gt; E[观察 → 隐状态]\n    C --&gt; F[隐状态 + 动作 → 下一隐状态 + 奖励]\n    D --&gt; G[隐状态 → 价值 + 策略]\n    E --&gt; H[MCTS 树搜索]\n    F --&gt; H\n    G --&gt; H\n    H --&gt; I[最佳动作]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>算法</th>\n<th>模型类型</th>\n<th>规划方法</th>\n<th>训练数据需求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>AlphaGo</td>\n<td>显式规则 + 神经网络</td>\n<td>MCTS</td>\n<td>大量专家棋谱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AlphaZero</td>\n<td>显式规则 + 自博弈</td>\n<td>MCTS</td>\n<td>自博弈生成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MuZero</td>\n<td>完全学习的模型</td>\n<td>MCTS</td>\n<td>自博弈 / 真实交互</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EfficientZero</td>\n<td>MuZero 改进</td>\n<td>MCTS + 重分析</td>\n<td>Atari 100k 数据 SOTA</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"muzero-的三函数架构\">MuZero 的三函数架构</h2><p>MuZero 把世界模型分解为三个独立的神经网络函数：</p>\n<p><strong>表征函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span></strong>：把原始观察 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">o_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 编码为隐状态 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_t = h(o_t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。这个函数只在每个时刻使用一次，作为 MCTS 搜索的入口。</p>\n<p><strong>动力学函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span></strong>：在隐空间预测转移和奖励，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(s_{t+1}, r_{t+1}) = g(s_t, a_t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。这个函数在 MCTS 树搜索的每个节点都被调用。</p>\n<p><strong>预测函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span></strong>：从隐状态预测策略和价值，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\pi_t, v_t) = f(s_t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。这个函数提供 MCTS 搜索的初始策略先验和价值估计。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[观察 o] --&gt; B[h: 表征]&#10;    B --&gt; C[隐状态 s_0]&#10;    C --&gt; D[g: 动力学]&#10;    D --&gt; E[s_1, r_1]&#10;    E --&gt; D&#10;    C --&gt; F[f: 预测]&#10;    F --&gt; G[策略 π, 价值 v]\">graph LR\n    A[观察 o] --&gt; B[h: 表征]\n    B --&gt; C[隐状态 s_0]\n    C --&gt; D[g: 动力学]\n    D --&gt; E[s_1, r_1]\n    E --&gt; D\n    C --&gt; F[f: 预测]\n    F --&gt; G[策略 π, 价值 v]</pre><p>这一架构的精妙之处在于：隐状态的语义完全由训练目标隐式定义，没有任何&quot;重建观察&quot;的约束。模型只需要让&quot;价值预测准确&quot;和&quot;奖励预测准确&quot;，隐空间会自动学到对决策有用的表征。这与 Dreamer 的&quot;重建观察&quot;范式形成对比。</p>\n<h2 id=\"mcts-muzero-的规划核心\">MCTS：MuZero 的规划核心</h2><p>MCTS（Monte Carlo Tree Search）是 MuZero 的决策过程。给定当前隐状态 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，MCTS 通过反复采样构建搜索树，每次模拟包含四个阶段：</p>\n<p><strong>选择（Selection）</strong>：从根节点出发，沿 UCB 策略选择子节点直到叶节点。UCB 公式平衡探索（访问次数少）与利用（价值高）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>puct</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>b</mi></munder><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U(s, a) = Q(s, a) + c_{\\text{puct}} \\cdot P(s, a) \\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{\\sum_b N(s, b)}}{1 + N(s, a)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7306em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">puct</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.566em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.63em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7199em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9101em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8701em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.28em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.28em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1296\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M263,681c0.7,0,18,39.7,52,119\nc34,79.3,68.167,158.7,102.5,238c34.3,79.3,51.8,119.3,52.5,120\nc340,-704.7,510.7,-1060.3,512,-1067\nl0 -0\nc4.7,-7.3,11,-11,19,-11\nH40000v40H1012.3\ns-271.3,567,-271.3,567c-38.7,80.7,-84,175,-136,283c-52,108,-89.167,185.3,-111.5,232\nc-22.3,46.7,-33.8,70.3,-34.5,71c-4.7,4.7,-12.3,7,-23,7s-12,-1,-12,-1\ns-109,-253,-109,-253c-72.7,-168,-109.3,-252,-110,-252c-10.7,8,-22,16.7,-34,26\nc-22,17.3,-33.3,26,-34,26s-26,-26,-26,-26s76,-59,76,-59s76,-60,76,-60z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3299em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>扩展（Expansion）</strong>：在叶节点用动力学函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span> 计算下一隐状态，用预测函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 计算策略先验和价值。</p>\n<p><strong>模拟（Simulation）</strong>：MuZero 没有传统 MCTS 的随机模拟——它直接使用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 输出的价值作为终止值。</p>\n<p><strong>反向传播（Backpropagation）</strong>：把价值沿搜索路径反向传播，更新所有访问节点的 Q 值。</p>\n<p>MCTS 的搜索深度通常 50-800 次模拟，让 MuZero 能进行深度多步推理。这种推理能力是 MuZero 在棋类、长时序游戏上超越 model-free 算法的关键。</p>\n<h2 id=\"学习与自博弈\">学习与自博弈</h2><p>MuZero 的训练是通过自博弈（self-play）+ 监督学习的组合：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>自博弈生成数据</strong>：用当前最新的网络进行 MCTS，与自己对弈/玩游戏，记录每个时刻的（状态、动作、奖励、价值估计、策略分布）。</li>\n<li><strong>离线训练网络</strong>：在记录的数据上训练三个函数，让它们的预测尽可能接近自博弈中观察到的真实结果。</li>\n<li><strong>网络更新</strong>：训练好的网络用于下一轮自博弈，形成不断迭代的循环。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>具体的损失函数包含三部分：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>价值损失</strong>：预测价值与 MCTS 价值的均方误差。</li>\n<li><strong>奖励损失</strong>：预测奖励与真实奖励的均方误差。</li>\n<li><strong>策略损失</strong>：预测策略与 MCTS 访问分布的交叉熵。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这种&quot;通过 MCTS 改进策略 + 通过策略改进网络&quot;的循环，是 AlphaZero 思想在 MuZero 中的延续。</p>\n<h2 id=\"efficientzero-样本效率的突破\">EfficientZero：样本效率的突破</h2><p>MuZero 原版需要数亿步训练才能在 Atari 上达到顶级水平。EfficientZero（南京大学，2021）通过几个关键改进，让 MuZero 在 Atari 100k benchmark（每个游戏只用 10 万帧）上达到了人类水平：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[EfficientZero 改进] --&gt; B[自监督一致性]&#10;    A --&gt; C[端到端价值预测]&#10;    A --&gt; D[off-policy 重分析]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[隐空间下一帧自监督]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[直接预测最终回报]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[历史数据重新评估]\">graph LR\n    A[EfficientZero 改进] --&gt; B[自监督一致性]\n    A --&gt; C[端到端价值预测]\n    A --&gt; D[off-policy 重分析]\n    B --&gt; B1[隐空间下一帧自监督]\n    C --&gt; C1[直接预测最终回报]\n    D --&gt; D1[历史数据重新评估]</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>自监督一致性损失</strong>：在隐空间增加自监督预测任务，让隐空间表征更稳定。</li>\n<li><strong>端到端价值预测</strong>：直接预测整个轨迹的折扣回报，而非逐步预测。</li>\n<li><strong>Off-policy 重分析</strong>：用最新模型重新评估历史数据的价值估计。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些改进让 MuZero 范式在样本受限场景也能应用，扩大了它的适用范围。</p>\n<h2 id=\"在推荐系统中的应用\">在推荐系统中的应用</h2><p>YouTube 推荐系统在 2023 年公开了基于 MuZero 的实验——把推荐视为长期决策问题（最大化用户长期满意度而非单次点击），用 MuZero 学习用户响应模型 + 规划最佳推荐序列。这一工作展示了 MuZero 在非游戏场景的潜力：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>状态</strong>：用户当前画像与历史。</li>\n<li><strong>动作</strong>：候选推荐物品。</li>\n<li><strong>奖励</strong>：用户的实际点击、观看、留存信号。</li>\n<li><strong>MCTS</strong>：在内部模型中模拟&quot;如果推荐 A，用户后续会怎样&quot;。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这种应用让推荐系统从&quot;基于即时反馈的反应式&quot;升级为&quot;基于长期价值的规划式&quot;，是 MuZero 商业化最成功的案例之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与-dreamer-的对比\">与 Dreamer 的对比</h2><p>MuZero 和 Dreamer 都是当前主流的世界模型 + RL 算法，但有显著差异：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>MuZero</th>\n<th>Dreamer</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>隐空间约束</td>\n<td>仅约束价值/奖励/策略预测</td>\n<td>约束观察重建</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>规划方法</td>\n<td>MCTS 离散搜索</td>\n<td>想象 rollout 连续轨迹</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适合动作空间</td>\n<td>离散为主</td>\n<td>连续与离散均可</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计算成本</td>\n<td>推理时高（MCTS）</td>\n<td>推理时低（直接策略）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>训练样本效率</td>\n<td>中（特别是 EfficientZero）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>工程实践中，棋类、卡牌等离散决策问题选 MuZero；机器人控制、导航等连续控制问题选 Dreamer。两者并非互斥而是各擅胜场。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>MuZero 是世界模型 + 规划范式最成功的工程化实践之一，从棋类游戏推广到 Atari、推荐系统等极其多样的场景。其核心架构（三函数学习模型 + MCTS 规划）是经典 AlphaZero 思想的自然延伸；EfficientZero 等后续工作让样本效率大幅提升。理解 MuZero 不仅是理解一个算法，更是理解&quot;通过学习模型 + 显式规划获得超越 model-free RL 的能力&quot;这一根本范式。把 MuZero 作为决策类世界模型的标准基准，是任何 RL 研究者的必修课。它在 2019-2024 年的影响仍然持续在新一代算法（EfficientZero、Sampled MuZero、Stochastic MuZero）中演进，是世界模型领域最有生命力的方向之一。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"MuZero 与基于模型的规划","id":"muzero-与基于模型的规划"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"MuZero 的三函数架构","id":"muzero-的三函数架构"},{"level":2,"text":"MCTS：MuZero 的规划核心","id":"mcts-muzero-的规划核心"},{"level":2,"text":"学习与自博弈","id":"学习与自博弈"},{"level":2,"text":"EfficientZero：样本效率的突破","id":"efficientzero-样本效率的突破"},{"level":2,"text":"在推荐系统中的应用","id":"在推荐系统中的应用"},{"level":2,"text":"与 Dreamer 的对比","id":"与-dreamer-的对比"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Dreamer 系列","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/world-models-simulation/classical-world-models/dreamer-family"},"next":{"title":"基于模型的强化学习基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/world-models-simulation/classical-world-models/model-based-rl-foundations"}}